// SR032 AST-improvement: getData(...) is also a query primitive in
// this language. The legacy regex hardcoded `getSqlData`, so two
// identical getData calls slipped through. The AST recognises both
// query functions.
rowsA := getData("SELECT id FROM mxthing WHERE code = 'A'");
rowsB := getData("SELECT id FROM mxthing WHERE code = 'A'");
